  "summary": "把每个数放入编号一到 numSlots 的槽，每槽至多两个数，最大化每个数与槽编号按位与之和。",
  "insight": "每个槽容量为零、一、二，可用三进制状态记录占用数。按 nums 下标递归，把当前数尝试放进任一未满槽，记忆化状态。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "槽编号从一开始参与按位与",
    "不是每个槽都必须使用",
    "三进制位值二表示已满"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "ternary-mask-dynamic-programming",
      "title": "三进制状态压缩动态规划",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "用每槽三种占用状态避免展开成重复位置排列。",
      "steps": [
        "powers[slot]=3^slot，memo 按 mask 初始化未计算",
        "dfs(index,mask)：index==nums.length 返回零",
        "枚举 slot，digit=(mask/powers[slot])%3；digit<2 时转移 (nums[index]&(slot+1))+dfs(index+1,mask+powers[slot])",
        "缓存最大值"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(3^slots·slots)",
        "space": "O(3^slots)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/ternary-mask-dynamic-programming/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/ternary-mask-dynamic-programming/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/ternary-mask-dynamic-programming/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
